# Mendix project
#
# Each Mendix app lives in its own subfolder (App/, and any future siblings), so
# these patterns must match at any depth. mxcli generates them root-anchored
# (/deployment/, /javasource/system/, …), which only works for a single app
# sitting directly in the repo root.
#
# Note the `**/` prefixes: a gitignore pattern that *contains* a slash is
# anchored to the .gitignore's directory even without a leading one, so
# `javasource/*/proxies/` alone would NOT match `App/javasource/x/proxies/`.
# Single-segment patterns (deployment/, .classpath) match at any depth already.
**/node_modules/
!**/javascriptsource/**/node_modules/
*.launch
.classpath
.mendix-cache/
.project
deployment/
**/javasource/*/proxies/
**/javasource/system/
modeler-merge-marker
**/nativemobile/builds/
packages/
project-settings.user.json
releases/
*.mpr.lock
*.mpr.bak
**/vendorlib/temp/
.svn/

# MPR v2 journal files
**/mprcontents/mprjournal*

# OS
.DS_Store

# mxcli
.claude/settings.local.json
/mxcli
/mxcli.exe
.mxcli/
